WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.533
Welcome to the Man
of Recaps, this is Echo.

00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:05.100
In the Hawkeye show, we met villain Maya Lopez,

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.466
who was a top boss in the criminal organization

00:00:07.466 --> 00:00:09.600
of Wilson Fisk, yes, Kingpin!

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.433
Maya is a deaf Native American girl 
who had a happy family

00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:15.366
until her mom died in a car accident
where she lost her leg.

00:00:15.366 --> 00:00:17.333
She and her dad moved to New York,
where he's a good guy,

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:19.133
but a criminal working for Kingpin.

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:22.533
And Fisk himself took an interest in young
Maya, became her mentor and “uncle.”

00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:26.433
One day Hawkeye, in his “Ronin” faze,
attacked and killed her father, no!

00:00:26.433 --> 00:00:28.466
But this brought her even 
closer to her uncle Kingpin, 

00:00:28.466 --> 00:00:30.766
who made her an enforcer
because she's a top tier fighter.

00:00:30.766 --> 00:00:33.100
But she's not as good as--
oh, who's that?!

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.133
Yes, it's Daredevil!

00:00:35.133 --> 00:00:36.866
They have an awesome fight, hyah!

00:00:36.866 --> 00:00:39.133
Oh, it's good to see him in action again!

00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:41.200
But unfortunately, he's not in this show,

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.100
he just came in for this one scene.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.800
And now catching up
to the events of Hawkeye, he told Maya

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.633
it was actually Fisk
who told him to kill her dad!

00:00:48.633 --> 00:00:52.666
So she confronted her Uncle Wilson,
and shot him in the face.

00:00:52.666 --> 00:00:54.633
But Kingpin is a tough guy to kill,

00:00:54.633 --> 00:00:56.866
he survived a bullet to the brain.

00:00:56.866 --> 00:00:59.433
So now Maya is on the 
run from Kingpin's gang.

00:00:59.433 --> 00:01:01.500
She goes back to her hometown in Oklahoma

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.700
and has homecoming shenanigans
like meeting up with her cousin Biscuits.

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.933
Her cousin Bonnie
she was real close with as a kid,

00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:08.400
but she doesn't even tell her she's back,

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.166
to just let Bonnie live a normal life.

00:01:10.166 --> 00:01:12.833
She goes to the roller skating rink 
where her Uncle Henry works.

00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:14.900
But Henry also works for Fisk in shipping.

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:17.700
Maya wants his help to take over
and become the “Queen-pin,”

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.633
but Henry doesn't want to 
bring trouble to their town.

00:01:19.633 --> 00:01:21.966
So Maya goes alone
for an epic train heist!

00:01:21.966 --> 00:01:24.066
Well almost alone, her
cousin Biscuits picks her up.

00:01:24.066 --> 00:01:27.000
But she didn't steal anything,
she planted a bomb!

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.666
Boom! Blows up Fisk’s weapons warehouse!

00:01:29.666 --> 00:01:32.833
Now this random guy from the roller
rink captures Maya to collect her bounty.

00:01:32.833 --> 00:01:36.333
Bonnie happened to come by too, so
they're both captured, cousins reunited.

00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:38.366
A goofy British gangster
comes to collect her,

00:01:38.366 --> 00:01:41.166
but Maya is real resourceful, makes 
a gun out of a roller blade

00:01:41.166 --> 00:01:45.133
and manages to escape! Has an epic fight,
throws ski balls at these dudes!

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:48.433
But in the end they're about to kill her,
when they get the call to let her go...

00:01:48.433 --> 00:01:51.466
Because Kingpin himself
has traveled to Oklahoma

00:01:51.466 --> 00:01:53.600
to see his wayward niece in person.

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:55.566
And he's not here to kill her,
he just wants to talk.

00:01:55.566 --> 00:01:58.533
We get more of their backstory,
of how he was protective of young Maya,

00:01:58.533 --> 00:02:01.566
beat this guy to death
because he wouldn't sell her ice cream.

00:02:01.566 --> 00:02:04.133
And he's like, “Look, sorry
about your dad, that was just business.”

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:06.366
“You shot me in the face, 
I think we're even now.” 

00:02:06.366 --> 00:02:08.566
“But, Maya, I really think of you as my family,”

00:02:08.566 --> 00:02:10.566
“I want you to come back and work
for me”

00:02:10.566 --> 00:02:13.100
 “and be the heir to my criminal empire.”

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:15.966
Maya's conflicted, but Fisk is 
a really persuasive guy

00:02:15.966 --> 00:02:18.600
who's good at manipulating 
impressionable young minds.

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:22.133
He pulls out his go-to move
and tells a story, “When I was a boy...”

00:02:22.133 --> 00:02:23.966
He gives her the hammer
he killed his father with,

00:02:23.966 --> 00:02:27.300
but she doesn't kill him,
so maybe these two can be family again.

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:30.233
But, meanwhile, Maya has been reconnecting
with her real family.

00:02:30.233 --> 00:02:32.766
And she's been having weird visions
of her ancestors,

00:02:32.766 --> 00:02:34.700
It's like “Yo Grandma, what's going on?”

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:36.366
And her grandma tells her
how they're all connected,

00:02:36.366 --> 00:02:38.633
and her own mom
in fact, had healing powers.

00:02:38.633 --> 00:02:41.966
So Maya has a good long think 
about who her real family is,

00:02:41.966 --> 00:02:44.300
and she decides to bail on Fisk.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:47.500
But Fisk does not take rejection well,
he kidnaps her grandma.

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:50.100
So Maya puts on the new 
prosthetic leg her grandpa built, 

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:53.200
and the Choctaw inspired super 
suit her grandma sewed.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.966
So it comes down to the grand finale
at the Powwow Party,

00:02:55.966 --> 00:02:58.166
where she confronts
Fisk to save her family.

00:02:58.166 --> 00:03:00.166
Of course, she walked 
directly into a trap,

00:03:00.166 --> 00:03:04.966
but now the powers of her ancestors
“echo” down through the ages to her!

00:03:04.966 --> 00:03:09.200
And yeah, it's not metaphorical,
she gets superpowers, all right!

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:12.300
Outside, the British gangster
is going to blow up the powwow,

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:14.433
but luckily her Uncle Henry
is there to stop it.

00:03:14.433 --> 00:03:17.400
And also Cousin Biscuits 
rolls up in a monster truck

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.533
to take out the rest of Fisk's goons!

00:03:19.533 --> 00:03:23.400
So now Echo grabs her Uncle Fisk
and uses her powers to get in his mind.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:26.033
But she doesn't want to kill him,
he really is like family too,

00:03:26.033 --> 00:03:28.400
so she tries to heal him of his own
childhood traumas.

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:32.133
It doesn't really seem like it worked,
but Fisk does leave her alone for now.

00:03:32.133 --> 00:03:34.233
On his flight back to New York,
the news reminds him

00:03:34.233 --> 00:03:38.800
that the mayoral election is coming up,
and now it seems like he's going to run.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.366
As for Maya Lopez, she's 
reconnected with her family, 

00:03:41.366 --> 00:03:45.000
decided to leave her life of crime 
behind, and be a hero now, “Echo.”

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:47.466
And that's where Echo comes to an end.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.533
If you like this recap hit that subscribe button 

00:03:50.533 --> 00:03:53.633
for more of the best 
recaps of TV and movies.

